The data show that the ADC outperforms anti-TNF on both efficacy (inflammation reduction in both models) and bone-density loss (lower osteoporosis risk). No listed statement accurately captures these outcomes without introducing factual errors about relative efficacy, identical risk, untested same-dose GRM comparisons, or “correct” dosing assumptions.}

(The analysis is based solely on direct numerical comparisons across the three experiments; statements that assert equivalence of risk, untested dose effects, or reversed efficacy rankings are inconsistent with the reported values.)

